# MESSAGE: every CTQ cited by a DFLSSProject via dflss:hasCTQ must already be an admitted req:AdmittedCtq (source/measure/verification/negative-case/control-plan gated at the requirements-andon layer); any row is a refusal.
PREFIX dflss: <https://ggen.dev/dflss#>
PREFIX req: <https://ggen.io/onto/requirements/>
SELECT ?project ?ctq WHERE {
  ?project a dflss:DFLSSProject ; dflss:hasCTQ ?ctq .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?ctq a req:AdmittedCtq }
}
ORDER BY ?project ?ctq
